    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398890/extras/a06430dc7a26ba0d200386a742f07d37.avif?t=1702964783\" /></div><br><br>Fast Jump: It is an action game in which you must move quickly to stay alive. Teleport between platforms and shoot all monsters you encounter along the way. Power-ups will help you, as long as you know how to use them. In every mission you will have a boss for you to defeat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Have fun shooting at <strong>different monsters</strong>;<br></li><li> With an <strong>engaging soundtrack</strong>, several independent songs;<br></li><li> <strong>Different missions and bosses</strong> that get more and more difficult;<br></li><li> <strong>Two game modes</strong>: Campaign and Adventure;<br></li><li> <strong>Fun power-ups </strong>that will help you defeat the monsters;<br></li><li> <strong>Multiple characters</strong> for you to unlock;</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398890/extras/a06430dc7a26ba0d200386a742f07d37.avif?t=1702964783\" /></div><br><br>Fast Jump: It is an action game in which you must move quickly to stay alive. Teleport between platforms and shoot all monsters you encounter along the way. Power-ups will help you, as long as you know how to use them. In every mission you will have a boss for you to defeat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Have fun shooting at <strong>different monsters</strong>;<br></li><li> With an <strong>engaging soundtrack</strong>, several independent songs;<br></li><li> <strong>Different missions and bosses</strong> that get more and more difficult;<br></li><li> <strong>Two game modes</strong>: Campaign and Adventure;<br></li><li> <strong>Fun power-ups </strong>that will help you defeat the monsters;<br></li><li> <strong>Multiple characters</strong> for you to unlock;</li></ul>",
